00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
THE GOOD OL DAYS:
Do you remember how it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.520
was to buy a computer back in the early 2000s? For&nbsp;
the first day or two after buying a new computer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:11.840
we would spend all of our time setting it up.&nbsp;
We would install things like Microsoft Office,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:18.320
Chrome, Adobe Flash, drivers, uTorrent, and maybe&nbsp;
a few games. We would also spend 3 hours waiting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:24.040
