00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:35.760
of how exactly this setup process looked for&nbsp;
you, one thing that we would all do to finish&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:41.960
the coronation of our new computers was install&nbsp;
Anti Virus protection software. We would use a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:48.160
McAfee CD or Norton flash drive and enable our&nbsp;
1 year free trials that came with the computer.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:53.160
We all felt that this was a necessary part of&nbsp;
not only keeping our data safe but keeping our&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:58.960
computers operational as fatal computer viruses&nbsp;
were a dime a dozen. After this initial setup,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:04.120
we usually see McAfee or Norton every time&nbsp;
we boot up our computers, informing us that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:09.320
they’re doing a malware scan to make sure our&nbsp;
