00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:21.280
the threat with just one click. As we clicked&nbsp;
eliminate threat on these pop ups, for a moment,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:26.920
we would feel an overwhelming sense of relief&nbsp;
because from experience, we all knew how annoying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:32.800
